      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "isnt necessarily world specific. I do notice different client behavior as well. One time I start vrchat everything is fine, another time my avatar makes my client freeze for almost a second during first load. (switching out and a couple of minutes later back in its fine)\n\nFeels like something potentially with the Caching, since when I emptied and moved my folder to another drive everything was fine - until i restarted my client and then the \"issue\" occured again. (As of writing now I didnt see the spiking the last two days) I have currently no way of replicating it at will",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
