      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f2def4d22470972dc58f6a2|full_name}: I can reproduce the issue as well. Something interesting as soon as VRChat unload the unused avatars (every 60 seconds), loading the same avatars stutter again. I do notice this behavior as well on the Live client but the stutter is way shorter (about 2-3 time)",
