  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-09-01T21:46:30.781Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I get about a one-second (or longer) lagspike when someone switches an avatar in the open beta. I asked other users in the instance and they had the same problem. The game hangs for a second and goes to the SteamVR grey screen every time a new avatar is loaded.\n\nI switched off the open beta and the problem stopped happening.\n\nSince I don't see much other reports on the issue here, it might be world-specific. The issue happened in this world: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_fb27b756-fd6a-44ff-ae28-6c8642499aa4",
